    "status": "filter_repo_selected_for_p07_candidate",
    "method": "git-filter-repo",
    "reason": "It is the only rehearsed method that preserves destination path history and blame while excluding provider implementation paths from the connector graph.",
    "refPolicy": "Use audit-approved source refs only as immutable selectors, rewrite every selected ref in one pass, then retain the rewritten refs under collision-free CLI and connector namespaces until P07 approves final public refs. Original commit/tag object IDs and signatures cannot survive a path rewrite.",
